# Cubwarden mutates over Bio-Asset Allocator, on top (CR 702.140c): the merged creature is Cubwarden, a Cat and no
# artifact, with all the abilities of both its cards (CR 702.140e), so Bio-Asset Allocator's grant still gives the
# Ornithopter "Whenever this creature attacks, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life" (CR 604.1). Both attack
# on turn 3: the Ornithopter drains 1, the merged Cubwarden - not an artifact creature - drains nothing, and its 3
# lifelink damage makes Bot2 lose 3 more and Bot1 gain 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Bio-Asset Allocator
Ornithopter
Plains
Cubwarden
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

